        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Remove MediaTrackSettings, inline in MediaStreamTrack.getSettings]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45936</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45936"/>
        <updated>2026-10-01T00:46:01.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">Continuing working on <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2037928647" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/30961" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/30961/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/30961">#30961</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">The approach is to condense information from three places: <code class="notranslate">MediaTrackSettings</code> landing page, <code class="notranslate">MediaTrackSettings.[property]</code>, and <code class="notranslate">MediaTrackConstraints.[property]</code>, and coalesce them ALL into a DL on <code class="notranslate">getSettings</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto">Commits:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/3b2838d5d781a9b83173d4413f4be7adf73f9f1d/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/3b2838d5d781a9b83173d4413f4be7adf73f9f1d"><tt>3b2838d</tt></a> - execute the delete-and-redirect; mechanical updates to the broken URLs. No content moved yet.</li>
<li><a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/6933420a7d0d8623762164cc40f82ae3e5c06fa0/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/6933420a7d0d8623762164cc40f82ae3e5c06fa0"><tt>6933420</tt></a> - move the DL and intro from <code class="notranslate">MediaTrackSettings</code> landing page over the "Return value". Add the intro and "Value" section from <code class="notranslate">MediaTrackSettings.[property]</code> to every DL item. Absolutely no editorial fixup, so content is duplicated as heck.</li>
<li><a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/5c10867693da729995d7b1a2782b67ef7d83d7e9/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/5c10867693da729995d7b1a2782b67ef7d83d7e9"><tt>5c10867</tt></a> - move any examples from the deleted pages. The other two examples, namely <code class="notranslate">restrictOwnAudio</code> and <code class="notranslate">suppressLocalAudioPlayback</code>, have absolutely nothing to do with <code class="notranslate">getSettings</code> or <code class="notranslate">MediaTrackSettings</code> and are simply dropped.</li>
<li><a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/2dbd6b8526cbc7728b76d7fb57a772a93157552c/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/2dbd6b8526cbc7728b76d7fb57a772a93157552c"><tt>2dbd6b8</tt></a> - create a "See also" that's the union of the see also items of each page, minus links to MediaTrackConstraints or MediaTrackSettings.</li>
<li><a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/95f654f26e11f57251589f990097eacd9faaf368/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/95f654f26e11f57251589f990097eacd9faaf368"><tt>95f654f</tt></a> - just does one thing: remove line wrapping.</li>
<li><a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/faf84b3dec2aaf13e1b08e3c82248b72c0da501f/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/faf84b3dec2aaf13e1b08e3c82248b72c0da501f"><tt>faf84b3</tt></a> - remove remaining references to <code class="notranslate">MediaTrackSettings</code>, remove a few value descriptions that are clearly duplicated.</li>
</ul>]]></content>
