        <title type="html"><![CDATA[WebTransport.getsStats() - fix to current spec]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45923</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45923"/>
        <updated>2026-09-29T02:18:25.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF158 implemented <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebTransport/getStats" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">WebTransport.getStats()</code></a> in  <a href="https://bugzil.la/2007202" rel="nofollow">https://bugzil.la/2007202</a></p>
<p dir="auto">This updates the page to include the current set of stats in the spec, with the exception of <code class="notranslate">bytesSentOverhead</code> which isn't implemented anywhere. The previous proprties were exposed but not readable on any platform so no loss.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5617211633" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45893" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45893/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45893">#45893</a></p>
<p dir="auto">NOTE I am away on holiday and won't be back until late October. If you can make changes to make this PR mergable, please do, and merge it.</p>]]></content>
